# Branching strategy

Never create or push branches whose names start with `cursor/`.

Every branch name must start with one of these prefixes:

- `feature/` — new capability or intentional product change
- `bug/` — fix for incorrect or broken behavior
- `experiment/` — exploratory or throwaway work that may not ship

Use lowercase kebab-case after the prefix (for example `feature/offline-retry`, `bug/session-cookie`, `experiment/paper-redesign`).

Do not use bare names, personal prefixes, or agent-default prefixes such as `cursor/`.
